# Copy karke ".env" naam se save karo. Koi ek provider kaafi hai.
# Na bharo to app OFFLINE mode mein chalegi (PDF ke relevant hisse jawab mein milenge).

# --- Option 1: Claude (Anthropic) ---
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5

# --- Option 2: OpenAI / Groq / koi bhi OpenAI-compatible API ---
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1

# --- Option 3: Ollama (apne PC par free, local model) ---
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
# OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3.1
